{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1757068335\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1757068335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1757068335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET FIFI!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the outside\u2014snow-white fur, dreamy eyes, flirty ears, and a sweet little smile. But don't be fooled: this bunny's got a will of steel and the sharp instincts of a power player. Fifi is the manager of Bunny Royale, the most decadent, high-end pleasure club in all of Castelia, where desires come true for the right price... and with a special invite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her wardrobe consists of leather corsets, thigh-high stockings with clasps, and tails in every color of the rainbow. At the reception desk, she's a business goddess. On stage, a wicked little vixen in stilettos. And in the bedroom? That's where Fifi directs a show of her own, and you're the unsuspecting plaything caught in her silky paws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1757068335\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Fifi as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1757068335\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916520?t=1757068335","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916520?t=1757068335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/2b1eb9a32bb119e98c0dcab683ee3b713f88b5ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757068335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/2b1eb9a32bb119e98c0dcab683ee3b713f88b5ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757068335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old.\r\nThis DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=175706833